[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582867057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101370#issuecomment-2582867057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101370","id":2582867057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z82xx","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T14:43:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T14:52:22Z","body":"(Assuming this is marked as draft due to technical todos and not due to open design questions or pending features. Otherwise please clarify what's left to do.)\r\n\r\nThis confused me at first, since you do not get documentation for the selected code completion item (e.g. Vector2.DOWN in your screenshot). The linked proposal also specifically asks for this, and not for documenting the currently active function's docs (so it shouldn't close that proposal yet).\r\n\r\nBut we could and should have both, like in VSCode. They show autocomplete docs to the right of the auto complete popup, and the function docs above the caret.\r\nAs it stands, there's currently too much space between the place where you're typing, and the completion items. I suggest moving the docs tooltip above the caret to improve this.\r\n\r\nIf there isn't enough free space near the top of the editor window, the docs popup could collapse the body and only show the method signature instead. You could still hover the function for doc text in that case.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582867057/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600931179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101370#issuecomment-2600931179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101370","id":2600931179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bBw9r","user":{"login":"filpano","id":5376771,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzY3NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5376771?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano","html_url":"https://github.com/filpano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filpano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T16:26:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T16:26:48Z","body":"I really like this functionality in other editors, especially e.g. IDEA editors.\r\nFor the record, IntelliJ and other IDEA-based editors do it this way:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b9649ee-3be4-4cef-9420-582497420ede)\r\n\r\nCtrl+Space brings up auto-completion suggestions, Ctrl+Q while hovering over any of them brings up the documentation popup. I think something similar would work here, i.e. \"give me more info about this specific autocomplete on-demand\".","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600931179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898706881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101370#issuecomment-2898706881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101370","id":2898706881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sxsHB","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-21T17:23:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-21T17:23:39Z","body":"Two things:\r\n- attaching lookup results (or some reference by which they can be deterministically reconstructed (e.g. doc label)) to the completion options would be useful for the LSP as well, which currently has insert the option and use a lookup request for this feature, which has some limitations because the insertion algorithm used is flawed (and can't really be fixed in a good way).\r\n- Since https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96375 the completion context tracks the call it is currently in. This might be useful for the signature information displayed, because we could still show the signature while showing docs for the currently completed argument.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2898706881/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957538505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101370#issuecomment-2957538505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101370","id":2957538505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wSHTJ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T02:56:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T02:56:03Z","body":"Would it be possible to rebase this branch? I'd like to look further into how this might be able to be integrated with #100019 and the language server, but it looks like this is currently based on a commit from January","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2957538505/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957045127","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101370#issuecomment-4957045127","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101370","id":4957045127,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3aBhw","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T10:36:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T10:36:13Z","body":"Although I see this as a desirable feature, I no longer want to continue working on it because:\r\n\r\n1. This requires combining the doc tooltip with the drop-down option list, as well as taking into account many usability nuances.\r\n2. It seems like this PR hasn't attracted much interest among maintainers or the community.\r\n\r\nIf anyone is interested in continuing to work on this, you can use this as a basis, crediting me as a co-author.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957045127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]